Both products are cosmetic skin-care preparations put up for retail sale, so they fall in heading 3304, which covers beauty or skin-care preparations other than medicaments. Subheading 3304.99 covers the "other" preparations, which includes non-medicated eye creams and wrinkle balms. The 10-digit statistical suffix I chose is 3304.99.5000, the "Other" provision for products not otherwise specified, which I am recalling rather than checking against the current schedule.

The description does not give a unified classification for the two items, so the single best code covers both as skin-care creams and balms.

{"hts_code": "3304.99.5000", "reason": "Non-medicated eye cream and wrinkle balm for the face and body, put up for retail sale, are skin-care preparations under heading 3304, subheading 3304.99, in the residual 'other' provision."}
